---
/**
 * Cross-section of the sight line from the hotel to Tokyo Disneyland, showing
 * why the Disney Resort Line station building makes floors below 5 unreliable
 * for a park view.
 */
---

<figure class="not-prose my-10">
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line bg-card p-4 sm:p-6">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 800 400"
      class="h-auto w-full"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="view-diagram-title view-diagram-desc"
    >
      <title id="view-diagram-title">飯店客房到東京迪士尼樂園的視線剖面圖</title>
      <desc id="view-diagram-desc">
        剖面圖顯示飯店 9 層樓、中間的迪士尼度假區線車站站體，以及遠方的世界市集與灰姑娘城堡。
        8 樓與 5 樓的視線越過車站看到城堡，3 樓的視線被車站站體擋住。
      </desc>

      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="sky" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#eef4f6"></stop>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#fbf8f3"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient id="hotelFace" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#fdfbf7"></stop>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#efe7d9"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>

      <rect x="0" y="0" width="800" height="400" fill="url(#sky)" rx="8"></rect>

      <!-- Ground -->
      <line x1="20" y1="340" x2="780" y2="340" stroke="#d9d0c1" stroke-width="2"></line>

      <!-- Hotel block, 9 floors -->
      <rect x="60" y="60" width="140" height="280" fill="url(#hotelFace)" stroke="#c9bda8"
        stroke-width="1.5" rx="3"></rect>
      {
        Array.from({ length: 9 }, (_, i) => {
          const floor = 9 - i;
          const y = 60 + i * (280 / 9);
          const highlighted = floor === 8 || floor === 5 || floor === 3;
          return (
            <g>
              <line
                x1="60"
                y1={y}
                x2="200"
                y2={y}
                stroke="#ded4c2"
                stroke-width="1"
                stroke-dasharray={floor === 9 ? '0' : '3 3'}
              />
              <text
                x="72"
                y={y + 21}
                font-size="12"
                fill={highlighted ? '#0f4c5c' : '#8b8f99'}
                font-weight={highlighted ? '700' : '400'}
              >
                {floor}F
              </text>
              {highlighted && (
                <rect x="168" y={y + 8} width="24" height="14" fill="#0f4c5c" opacity="0.16" rx="2" />
              )}
            </g>
          );
        })
      }
      <text x="130" y="360" font-size="13" fill="#545a66" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">
        東京迪士尼樂園大飯店
      </text>

      <!-- Disney Resort Line station -->
      <rect x="255" y="228" width="150" height="112" fill="#e4ddd0" stroke="#c9bda8"
        stroke-width="1.5" rx="3"></rect>
      <rect x="243" y="216" width="174" height="14" fill="#cfc4b1" rx="3"></rect>
      <text x="330" y="290" font-size="12" fill="#6b6255" text-anchor="middle">度假區線</text>
      <text x="330" y="308" font-size="12" fill="#6b6255" text-anchor="middle">樂園站站體</text>
      <text x="330" y="360" font-size="12" fill="#8b8f99" text-anchor="middle">遮蔽低樓層視線</text>

      <!-- World Bazaar rooftops -->
      <path
        d="M450 340 V282 l26-22 26 22 v-14 l26-20 26 20 v18 l24-18 24 18 V340 Z"
        fill="#e8dfd0"
        stroke="#c9bda8"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
      <text x="530" y="360" font-size="12" fill="#8b8f99" text-anchor="middle">世界市集</text>

      <!-- Cinderella Castle -->
      <g stroke="#b9a98f" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="#f3ece0">
        <path d="M664 340 V236 h72 v104 Z"></path>
        <path d="M664 236 l36 -46 36 46 Z"></path>
        <path d="M652 340 V262 h18 v78 Z"></path>
        <path d="M652 262 l9 -26 9 26 Z"></path>
        <path d="M730 340 V262 h18 v78 Z"></path>
        <path d="M730 262 l9 -26 9 26 Z"></path>
      </g>
      <line x1="700" y1="190" x2="700" y2="168" stroke="#b4832c" stroke-width="2"></line>
      <circle cx="700" cy="164" r="4" fill="#b4832c"></circle>
      <text x="700" y="360" font-size="12" fill="#8b8f99" text-anchor="middle">灰姑娘城堡</text>

      <!-- Sight lines -->
      <g stroke-linecap="round">
        <line x1="200" y1="106" x2="716" y2="176" stroke="#0f4c5c" stroke-width="2.5"
          stroke-dasharray="7 5"></line>
        <line x1="200" y1="200" x2="716" y2="212" stroke="#0f4c5c" stroke-width="2.5"
          stroke-dasharray="7 5" opacity="0.75"></line>
        <line x1="200" y1="262" x2="258" y2="256" stroke="#8c2f4a" stroke-width="2.5"
          stroke-dasharray="7 5"></line>
      </g>

      <!-- Sight line labels -->
      <g font-size="12.5" font-weight="700">
        <rect x="214" y="80" width="196" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0f4c5c"></rect>
        <text x="312" y="95" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">8F：城堡與海洋火山全都看得到</text>

        <rect x="230" y="172" width="176" height="22" rx="11" fill="#0f4c5c" opacity="0.82"></rect>
        <text x="318" y="187" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">5F：勉強越過站體，看得到城堡</text>

        <rect x="214" y="236" width="150" height="22" rx="11" fill="#8c2f4a"></rect>
        <text x="289" y="251" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle">3F：整片被站體擋住</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-faint">
    示意剖面圖，非等比例。飯店與樂園之間隔著迪士尼度假區線的東京迪士尼樂園站，這是低樓層房間看不到樂園的主因。
    「樂園全景觀」房型全部位在 5 樓以上，就是為了避開這座站體。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
